                "iconUrl": "/-/jssmedia/5c65a0fc7f0448b995aa15d8a72bbd3a.ashx",
                "content": "<ul>\n    <li>A shared transfer will take you and others to and from your hotel along a planned route.&nbsp; As they run to a schedule, you may have to wait up to an hour before your transfer departs, but once on board there will be no more than 8 stops.</li>\n</ul>",
                "transferInfo": {
                    "arrivalInstr": "On arrival once you've collected your luggage and exited the baggage area into the main arrivals hall, please follow the directional overhead signs and floor markings towards the exit.  Before you reach Burger King, please look to your right where the local easyJet holidays team will be waiting to direct you to your transfer vehicle.  Bear in mind shuttle transfers sometimes operate on a schedule or need to wait for other customers so there may be a wait of up to one hour before departing.  If you have any difficulty in locating your transfer please call our local partner on +351 291 228113",
                    "depInstr": "When you're going home please ensure you are ready to go at the designated pick-up point, with all of your party and their luggage, 15 mins before the published time.  The day before you are going home, your pick-up information will be available at https://ejh.ecoviagens.com (you'll need your 7 digit holiday booking reference).  We'll also send you an SMS with the details.  If you have any problems with your transfer on the day of your departure, please contact our local partner on +351 291 228113",
